  "title": "Experimental autonomous execution is contained",
  "statement": "Experimental autonomous execution MUST require project opt-in and invocation-level experimental and write consent, MUST execute task-specific acceptance, and MUST preserve recoverable work at a human-review boundary without promoting supported readiness.",
